{
  "id": "13",
  "title": "Atlas ORM",
  "content": "<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.12) 0%, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.04) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2); border-left: 4px solid #F59E0B; padding: 32px; margin-bottom: 60px; border-radius: 4px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; top: -20px; right: -20px; opacity: 0.1; transform: rotate(15deg);\"><svg width=\"120\" height=\"120\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F59E0B\" stroke-width=\"1\"><path d=\"M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z\"/><path d=\"M2 17l10 5 10-5\"/><path d=\"M2 12l10 5 10-5\"/></svg></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-heading); font-weight: 300;\">**Atlas** 是 Gravito 的高效能資料骨幹。它提供了一個型別安全的 **Active Record ORM**，在 Eloquent 的豐富表現力與原生 SQL 的極致效能之間取得了完美的平衡。</p></div><h2>主動式智能 (Active Intelligence)</h2><p>Atlas 不僅僅是一個查詢構建器，它是一個資料編排層。它以「零抽象損耗」為目標，填補了您的領域邏輯與持久層之間的鴻溝。</p><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin: 48px 0;\" class=\"bento-grid\"><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(245,158,11,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"> <div style=\"color: #F59E0B; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"/><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">強型別約束</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">利用 TypeScript 裝飾器進行運行時 Schema 驗證、編譯時屬性安全檢查與內建的**樂觀鎖 (Optimistic Locking)** 支援。告別「字串型別」的模糊查詢。</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(245,158,11,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #F59E0B; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m12 3-1.912 5.813a2 2 0 0 1-1.275 1.275L3 12l5.813 1.912a2 2 0 0 1 1.275 1.275L12 21l1.912-5.813a2 2 0 0 1 1.275-1.275L21 12l-5.813-1.912a2 2 0 0 1-1.275-1.275L12 3Z\"/><path d=\"M5 3v4\"/><path d=\"M19 17v4\"/><path d=\"M3 5h4\"/><path d=\"M17 19h4\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">ACTIVE_RECORD</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">直觀的 <code>model.save()</code> 與 <code>model.delete()</code> 操作，讓您的代碼保持整潔且操作可預測。</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(245,158,11,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #F59E0B; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 20a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V5a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v14a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h16Z\"/><path d=\"M12 4v16\"/><path d=\"M3 12h18\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">多驅動支援</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">為 Postgres, MySQL, SQLite, MongoDB 與 Redis 提供統一的 API。只需一行配置即可切換後端。</p></div></div><h2>資料模型定義</h2><p>在 Atlas 中定義實體是聲明式的。裝飾器為引擎提供了必要的元數據，以便優化 SQL 的生成過程。</p><pre><code>import { Model, column } from '@gravito/atlas'\n\nexport class User extends Model {\n  static table = 'users'\n\n  @column({ isPrimary: true, autoIncrement: true })\n  declare id: number\n\n  @column()\n  declare email: string\n\n  @column({ type: 'json' })\n  declare settings: Record&lt;string, any&gt;\n}</code></pre><div style=\"background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1); border-left: 4px solid #F59E0B; padding: 24px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900; color: #F59E0B; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;\">// 核心衛生：延遲載入驅動</h4><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; color: var(--text-heading); opacity: 0.9; border: none; padding: 0;\">Atlas 對所有資料庫驅動程式使用動態導入。如果您使用 Postgres，則僅會載入 <code>pg</code> 驅動。這能保持您的運行時記憶體佔用最小，並讓部署構件保持精簡。</p></div><h2>流暢的查詢管道</h2><p>Atlas 查詢構建器模擬了人類的邏輯思維。它透過鏈式 API 輕鬆處理複雜的連結 (Joins)、預載入 (Eager Loading) 與分頁。</p><pre><code>const posts = await Post.query()\n  .with(['author', 'comments'])\n  .where('published', true)\n  .whereHas('author', (q) => q.where('active', true))\n  .orderBy('created_at', 'desc')\n  .paginate(1, 15)</code></pre><h2>效能：抽象成本</h2><p>Atlas 旨在將「ORM 稅」降至最低。我們利用 **JIT 查詢預處理** 確保您的邏輯與網路套接字之間的轉換時間以微秒計算。</p><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 4px;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #F59E0B; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>ATLAS_查詢開銷</span> <span>< 0.05ms</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(245,158,11,0.1); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 5%; background: #F59E0B; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(245,158,11,0.5);\"></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #6B7280; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>通用型 Node.js ORM 開銷</span> <span>~0.85ms</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 45%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\"></div></div></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; font-family: var(--font-technical); border: none; padding: 0;\">// 指標：ATLAS 比重量級 Node.js ORM 輕量 15 倍</p></div><div style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.1), transparent); border-left: 4px solid #6366F1; padding: 24px; margin-top: 60px; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; font-style: italic; border: none; padding: 0; color: var(--text-heading);\">**架構師洞察：** 資料的一致性不應以延遲作為代價。Atlas 提供 ORM 的保護機制，同時具備直接驅動連線的原生動力。它是驅動您最關鍵資料流的無聲引擎。</p></div>",
